== CANON-8 (r3.77): generic routines and structs of another module.
Use Generic.Tools

Main :
    B := Wrap("boxed")
    PutLn(Larger(4, 9), " ", Larger("a", "b"), " ", B.FItem, " ", Wrap(2.5).FItem)
;
